                cco:ont00001760 "https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ArtifactOntology"^^xsd:anyURI .


###  https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000423
cco:ont00000423 rdf:type owl:Class ;
                rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000782 ;
